WEBVTT

00:00:00.792 --> 00:00:02.419
Starting next year...

00:00:02.419 --> 00:00:05.714
Otonokizaka High will no longer be
accepting applications. It's closing down.

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:13.513
Is that really true?

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:14.431
You...!

00:00:14.639 --> 00:00:16.683
Is the school closing down, no matter what?

00:00:17.309 --> 00:00:18.435
Honoka-chan.

00:00:18.602 --> 00:00:19.394
Yes.

00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:23.064
Mama, nobody told us anything like that!

00:00:23.064 --> 00:00:25.817
Can't you hold off a little longer!?

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:26.776
Just one more week!

00:00:26.776 --> 00:00:29.529
No, we'll figure something out in two days!

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:38.663
If I may clarify, the school will only close
if our open campus doesn't go well.

00:00:39.497 --> 00:00:41.082
An open campus...?

00:00:41.249 --> 00:00:44.044
Is that when non-students can come
and look around the school?

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:47.172
All visiting middle school students will
be asked to complete a survey.

00:00:47.172 --> 00:00:49.841
If the results are unsatisfactory,
the school will be closed.

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:51.843
I just informed Ayase-san of this.

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:53.011
Oh, okay.

00:00:53.178 --> 00:00:55.221
Don't you dare take it easy now.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:58.558
The school's open campus is in
two weeks, on a Sunday.

00:00:59.017 --> 00:01:01.645
If it goes poorly, the situation
will become irreversible.

00:01:03.647 --> 00:01:04.773
What'll we do?

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:06.733
Director.

00:01:08.777 --> 00:01:13.657
The student council will propose which
events will be held during the open campus.

00:01:17.035 --> 00:01:19.162
I doubt anything I say would stop you.

00:01:19.162 --> 00:01:20.121
Pardon me.

00:01:33.301 --> 00:01:34.761
And what will our star do?

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:42.602
The only thing I can.

00:01:43.728 --> 00:01:45.438
We gotta do something!

00:01:57.701 --> 00:02:02.831
<i>Massugu ha omoi ga minna wo musubu Our honest
feelings are what will fie us all together.</i>

00:02:02.831 --> 00:02:07.669
Honki demo bukiyou butsukari au kokoro Even with
our clumsy sincerity, our hearts will still collide.

00:02:07.669 --> 00:02:12.465
Sore demo mitaiyo ohkina yume wa And despite
it all, we want to dream a really grand dream.

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:17.095
Koko ni aruyo hajimatta bakari That dream
is here, and it has only now just begun!

00:02:17.095 --> 00:02:18.138
(wakatteru)
(We understand)

00:02:18.138 --> 00:02:22.058
Tanoshii dakejanai tamesarerudarou That it's not
all fun and games— we'll face a lot of obstacles.

00:02:22.058 --> 00:02:23.017
(wakatteru)
(We understand)

00:02:23.017 --> 00:02:26.855
Datte sono kurushisa mo mirai That those
hardships will be paving our futures...

00:02:26.855 --> 00:02:27.897
ikundayo
So here we go!

00:02:27.897 --> 00:02:32.026
Atsumattara tsuyoi jibun ni nattekuyo If we all
join together, we'll be able to become stronger.

00:02:32.026 --> 00:02:36.656
(Kittone) kawari tsuzukete (WE'LL BE A STARY/) (We're sure
that) we will all grow and mature. (We'll become stars!)

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:41.661
Sorezore ga sukina koto de ganbarerunara That's why we feel
that if we give the things that we love the most our all,

00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:46.332
atarashii (basho ga) gohru dane what awaits
then (our new place) will be our goal.

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:51.504
Sorezore no sukina koto wo shinjiteireba That's why we
feel that if we believe in the things we love in our lives,

00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:56.468
tokimeki wo (daite) susumerudarou we can learn to
love (then embrace) our butterflies and advance!

00:02:56.468 --> 00:03:01.931
(kowagaru kuse wa sutechae) tobikiri no egao de So crumple up your
fears, throw them away, and then just put on your brightest smiles!

00:03:01.931 --> 00:03:09.522
(tonde tonde takaku) bokura wa ima no naka de (Higher and higher
we"ll fly) The lights that are shining within our hearts...

00:03:10.899 --> 00:03:14.277
kagayaki wo matteta
They're waiting to brighten the world.

00:03:16.696 --> 00:03:17.572
No way...

00:03:17.739 --> 00:03:21.451
Will we really be high schoolers
without any underclassmen?

00:03:21.618 --> 00:03:22.869
Seems that way.

00:03:24.454 --> 00:03:27.332
#8 - What I Want to Do
Sounds like less of a hassle to me.

00:03:27.499 --> 00:03:30.293
No matter what, we're gonna put on
a concert during the open campus!

00:03:30.627 --> 00:03:33.838
We gotta do our best to make more
girls wanna apply to our school!

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:36.674
The student council will henceforth
operate independent from the faculty.

00:03:36.674 --> 00:03:39.260
We must take action and prevent
our school from closing.

00:03:41.554 --> 00:03:42.347
What is it?

00:03:42.347 --> 00:03:43.431
Um, nothing.

00:03:43.807 --> 00:03:46.434
If you have something to say, then just say it.

00:03:46.601 --> 00:03:47.519
Okay.

00:03:48.895 --> 00:03:55.109
You want us to think of ways to increase
the number of enrolling students, right?

00:03:55.527 --> 00:03:55.985
Right.

00:03:56.152 --> 00:03:59.614
In that case, why don't we prepare a lot
of fun activities for the open campus?

00:03:59.614 --> 00:04:03.910
Our school's history is important,
and we have really good teachers,

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:08.081
but I feel like we've been
too stiff about having fun.

00:04:08.248 --> 00:04:12.293
For example, a lot of people say that
our school uniforms are really cute.

00:04:12.877 --> 00:04:15.380
Nice! We should think of ways
to promote stuff like that.

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:17.674
<i>Aren't school idols popular nowadays, 100?</i>

00:04:17.841 --> 00:04:20.134
Good idea! We have a group here, don't we?

00:04:20.301 --> 00:04:21.135
M's, right?

00:04:21.302 --> 00:04:23.930
Let's ask them to put on a concert for us.

00:04:24.097 --> 00:04:25.765
- Sounds great!
- Any other ideas?

00:04:27.851 --> 00:04:29.477
Other ideas...?

00:04:31.479 --> 00:04:33.523
These are...?

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:37.610
Yeah, well, our alpacas are pretty popular,
even among students from other schools.

00:04:40.321 --> 00:04:41.990
I don't know about this one.

00:04:50.123 --> 00:04:52.584
Miss Student Council President?

00:04:54.377 --> 00:04:55.587
Girls.

00:04:56.212 --> 00:04:57.422
Two of our school idols!

00:04:57.589 --> 00:04:58.506
Yes...?

00:04:58.506 --> 00:04:59.841
Perfect timing.

00:04:59.841 --> 00:05:02.552
There's an open campus soon,
and we were won—

00:05:02.552 --> 00:05:03.678
Wait!

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:06.097
We haven't decided on that yet.

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:08.349
Okay.

00:05:11.269 --> 00:05:12.854
One, two, three, four...

00:05:13.021 --> 00:05:15.064
Five, six, seven, eight.

00:05:16.149 --> 00:05:16.774
Yeah!

00:05:17.984 --> 00:05:19.235
Everyone's perfect!

00:05:19.402 --> 00:05:20.570
Oh, goodie!

00:05:20.737 --> 00:05:23.072
Maybe we'll be ready in
time for the open campus!

00:05:23.781 --> 00:05:26.159
Do you really think we can throw a concert?

00:05:26.159 --> 00:05:28.244
Won't the student council president stop us?

00:05:28.411 --> 00:05:29.746
Don't worry about that.

00:05:29.913 --> 00:05:32.832
All the clubs will definitely get the same
chance to introduce themselves.

00:05:32.999 --> 00:05:35.001
If that's when we sing, then...

00:05:35.001 --> 00:05:35.835
No good.

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:38.504
We're not quite in sync.

00:05:39.714 --> 00:05:40.715
Umi-chan...

00:05:41.591 --> 00:05:44.135
Okay, then we'll do it again.

00:05:44.302 --> 00:05:45.970
One, two, three, four...

00:05:46.137 --> 00:05:48.264
Five, six, seven, eight.

00:05:50.308 --> 00:05:51.768
Perfection!

00:05:51.935 --> 00:05:52.810
It sure was.

00:05:52.977 --> 00:05:56.230
It seems you've finally caught
up to my skill level.

00:05:56.397 --> 00:05:57.440
Not good enough.

00:05:57.607 --> 00:05:58.608
What?

00:05:59.442 --> 00:06:02.695
I don't think it can get much better than that...

00:06:02.695 --> 00:06:04.948
It's simply not good enough.

00:06:05.615 --> 00:06:07.325
What's not good enough about it?

00:06:07.492 --> 00:06:08.826
Come on, tell us.

00:06:10.161 --> 00:06:11.829
I don't feel moved by it.

00:06:12.622 --> 00:06:14.248
Not in its current state, anyway.

00:06:15.124 --> 00:06:16.209
Umi-chan...

00:06:17.502 --> 00:06:19.671
What!? The student council president?

00:06:20.004 --> 00:06:23.299
Uh-huh. Umi-chan says we should
have her teach us how to dance.

00:06:23.466 --> 00:06:23.967
Right.

00:06:24.634 --> 00:06:29.305
Watching her ballet performance caused
me to realize how far we've yet to go.

00:06:29.472 --> 00:06:31.766
Is that all you wanted to discuss?

00:06:31.766 --> 00:06:35.061
Even if we ask, the student
council president...

00:06:35.228 --> 00:06:37.021
She really hates us!

00:06:37.188 --> 00:06:39.315
It's just some petty jealousy.

00:06:39.482 --> 00:06:41.317
I thought that at first, too.

00:06:41.484 --> 00:06:42.276
But...

00:06:43.236 --> 00:06:49.575
I do understand how such a talented dancer
would see us all as nothing but amateurs.

00:06:49.742 --> 00:06:52.036
She must've been super amazing...

00:06:52.203 --> 00:06:53.663
I'm opposed to it.

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:55.039
She'd just have us quit.

00:06:55.873 --> 00:06:56.833
Yeah...

00:06:56.833 --> 00:07:00.545
I agree. As long as I'm around,
you don't need any more third years.

00:07:00.712 --> 00:07:03.297
The student council president
kind of scares me.

00:07:03.464 --> 00:07:05.758
I just wanna have fun.

00:07:06.134 --> 00:07:07.677
All valid points.

00:07:08.094 --> 00:07:10.221
I think it could be a good idea.

00:07:10.221 --> 00:07:10.763
What!?

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:12.098
You're kidding me!

00:07:12.265 --> 00:07:15.143
But we know a really talented dancer.

00:07:15.143 --> 00:07:18.396
So talking about having her teach us
ways to improve makes sense, right?

00:07:18.563 --> 00:07:19.480
Yes, well...

00:07:19.647 --> 00:07:21.482
I'm totally on board with that.

00:07:21.649 --> 00:07:22.608
Honoka-chan...

00:07:22.775 --> 00:07:24.485
Even if she'll say no, let's ask anyway.

00:07:24.652 --> 00:07:26.571
Hey! Hold on!

00:07:26.738 --> 00:07:27.864
But...

00:07:29.157 --> 00:07:32.618
I kinda wanna see Eli-senpai dance now.

00:07:33.327 --> 00:07:34.495
So do I.

00:07:34.662 --> 00:07:37.874
Okay, then we'll ask her first thing tomorrow.

00:07:38.332 --> 00:07:40.668
Don't blame me if it backfires.

00:07:44.505 --> 00:07:50.845
Otonokizaka has a treasured history, and
has been influential for local developments.

00:07:51.512 --> 00:07:55.767
Furthermore, the school began
primarily as a school of music,

00:07:55.767 --> 00:08:02.815
giving it an abundance of aspiring artists
to help create an inspiring atmosphere.

00:08:03.149 --> 00:08:04.484
Here at Otonokizaka High—

00:08:04.984 --> 00:08:06.235
I'm getting so fat!

00:08:08.362 --> 00:08:09.989
Oh, sorry.

00:08:11.866 --> 00:08:14.118
No, I'm sorry. Was it boring?

00:08:14.285 --> 00:08:16.746
No way, it was interesting!

00:08:16.746 --> 00:08:18.873
That last part, especially!

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:23.586
I can rewrite it up till the day of our
open campus, so please, don't be shy.

00:08:23.753 --> 00:08:26.089
I thought it was terrible.

00:08:26.255 --> 00:08:27.090
Hey!

00:08:27.256 --> 00:08:30.176
Why would you talk about that kind of stuff?

00:08:30.343 --> 00:08:32.595
Because I'd like to keep the school open.

00:08:32.762 --> 00:08:37.100
I don't want Otonokizaka to close either, but...

00:08:39.519 --> 00:08:41.687
Is this really how you want to achieve that?

00:08:44.941 --> 00:08:48.611
Nobody would want their school to close.

00:08:49.403 --> 00:08:51.030
You're right, but...

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:56.828
Aren't you trying a little
too hard on your end?

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:59.747
I wouldn't say that at all.

00:09:00.498 --> 00:09:02.166
Eli-chi, you're so stubborn.

00:09:02.333 --> 00:09:05.920
I want only for the school to remain open.

00:09:10.925 --> 00:09:11.843
Please.

00:09:12.593 --> 00:09:14.178
Me, your dance instructor?

00:09:14.345 --> 00:09:17.056
Yeah. Are you willing to give us a chance?

00:09:17.473 --> 00:09:20.017
We wanna get better.

00:09:24.438 --> 00:09:28.025
You've no right to talk down to us like that!

00:09:31.612 --> 00:09:32.155
Fine.

00:09:32.613 --> 00:09:33.614
Really?

00:09:33.781 --> 00:09:39.245
I don't get why you've made the choices
you have, but I can't deny your popularity.

00:09:39.412 --> 00:09:40.538
I accept.

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:47.211
But if I'm really going to do this for you, get
ready to practice till my standards are met.

00:09:47.211 --> 00:09:47.879
Understood?

00:09:50.548 --> 00:09:51.132
Yes!

00:09:51.674 --> 00:09:53.134
Thank you very much!

00:09:54.468 --> 00:09:56.179
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:09:57.805 --> 00:10:00.433
It seems the stars have begun to align.

00:10:02.351 --> 00:10:03.561
Love Live!

00:10:25.041 --> 00:10:27.501
Ayase-san, unfortunately...

00:10:29.629 --> 00:10:31.339
Missed the cut again?

00:10:32.256 --> 00:10:33.799
I'm sorry!

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:36.594
That's all right.

00:10:36.594 --> 00:10:39.055
Don't worry about one audition.

00:10:45.853 --> 00:10:48.147
- Rin-chan!
- Ow!

00:10:48.314 --> 00:10:51.734
Abysmal. I'm surprised you
even made it this far.

00:10:51.901 --> 00:10:52.944
Sorry...

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:55.363
I did it perfect yesterday!

00:10:55.363 --> 00:10:57.865
You're tripping over yourself because
you lack the fundamentals.

00:10:58.032 --> 00:10:58.866
Spread your legs.

00:11:00.159 --> 00:11:01.285
How's this?

00:11:01.452 --> 00:11:03.079
That hurts!

00:11:03.246 --> 00:11:08.334
You must be able to touch your stomach to
the floor while your legs are spread like this.

00:11:08.501 --> 00:11:08.960
Huh!?

00:11:09.377 --> 00:11:11.879
Increased flexibility is vital
for every thing you do.

00:11:12.046 --> 00:11:14.173
You should all be able to do this.

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:18.010
At the rate you're going, any concert
you put on will be a risk.

00:11:18.803 --> 00:11:20.930
She's bad news. Called it.

00:11:23.808 --> 00:11:26.018
Kotori-chan, you're awesome!

00:11:26.185 --> 00:11:28.145
Don't just gawk at her.

00:11:28.312 --> 00:11:29.355
Who else can do it?

00:11:29.522 --> 00:11:31.399
Don't you want others to be
entranced by your dancing?

00:11:31.899 --> 00:11:33.818
These are the very basics!

00:11:35.278 --> 00:11:36.445
Ten more minutes!

00:11:36.612 --> 00:11:38.072
O-Okay!

00:11:38.239 --> 00:11:41.867
We're going through our
strength exercises again!

00:11:42.285 --> 00:11:43.911
One more set!

00:11:50.876 --> 00:11:51.961
Kayo-chin...!

00:11:53.379 --> 00:11:55.256
Kayo-chin, are you okay?

00:11:55.423 --> 00:11:56.924
I-I'm fine.

00:11:57.091 --> 00:11:58.968
Enough. We're done for today.

00:11:59.969 --> 00:12:01.178
What's your deal?

00:12:01.345 --> 00:12:03.055
No need to be so cold about it.

00:12:03.222 --> 00:12:05.474
It was a calm evaluation.

00:12:05.641 --> 00:12:08.686
Are you more aware of how
little you're capable of now?

00:12:08.853 --> 00:12:12.815
Our school's continued existence depends
on the upcoming open campus.

00:12:12.982 --> 00:12:15.276
If you don't think you can do this, tell me now.

00:12:16.193 --> 00:12:17.570
I can't afford to waste my time.

00:12:17.737 --> 00:12:18.946
Wait!

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:28.080
Thank you very much!

00:12:29.874 --> 00:12:31.500
Please continue to teach us tomorrow!

00:12:32.001 --> 00:12:33.252
Please!

00:12:41.844 --> 00:12:42.470
Alisa.

00:12:42.928 --> 00:12:44.013
Hey, sis.

00:12:45.222 --> 00:12:45.973
May 1?7

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:55.775
Watching p's perform makes
my heart feel really warm.

00:12:56.734 --> 00:13:00.279
They work so hard, and they look
like they're having so much fun...

00:13:01.489 --> 00:13:02.948
But they aren't good.

00:13:04.367 --> 00:13:06.660
Not compared to you, maybe...

00:13:08.162 --> 00:13:10.373
But they still lift my spirits!

00:13:17.421 --> 00:13:18.422
Mornin'!

00:13:18.714 --> 00:13:19.340
Hi!

00:13:19.507 --> 00:13:20.633
Good morning.

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:22.468
All right! Ready to do this!?

00:13:26.222 --> 00:13:27.681
What is this, espionage?

00:13:29.058 --> 00:13:29.600
No.

00:13:34.605 --> 00:13:35.689
Hey!

00:13:35.856 --> 00:13:37.316
Good morning.

00:13:38.818 --> 00:13:40.653
Should we start with stretches?

00:13:41.654 --> 00:13:42.571
Wasn't it rough?

00:13:42.738 --> 00:13:43.572
What?

00:13:43.739 --> 00:13:45.199
You did a lot yesterday.

00:13:45.366 --> 00:13:47.576
And you'll be doing the same things today.

00:13:47.743 --> 00:13:51.038
Who knows if you'll even be able to improve?

00:13:51.872 --> 00:13:52.998
But we wanna do this!

00:13:54.125 --> 00:13:56.669
Yeah, practice can be really exhausting.

00:13:56.836 --> 00:13:58.295
My whole body's sore.

00:13:58.462 --> 00:14:03.551
But our feelings of wanting this school to
stay open are just as strong as yours!

00:14:05.177 --> 00:14:08.514
That's why... Please teach us again today!

00:14:08.681 --> 00:14:10.057
Please!

00:14:14.103 --> 00:14:15.438
Miss Student Council President.

00:14:23.487 --> 00:14:25.781
Is this really how you want to achieve that?

00:14:25.781 --> 00:14:26.907
But we wanna do this!

00:14:27.074 --> 00:14:32.413
Watching u's perform makes
my heart feel really warm.

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:35.875
They work so hard, and they look
like they're having so much fun...

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:37.793
Y'know...

00:14:38.502 --> 00:14:39.503
Nozomi?

00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:43.132
Ever since we became friends
and I joined the student council,

00:14:43.132 --> 00:14:45.301
something's always poked
at the back of my mind.

00:14:46.051 --> 00:14:49.388
What is it that you really want to do?

00:14:50.306 --> 00:14:52.516
I know you well, so I know this isn't it.

00:14:53.142 --> 00:14:56.896
You're always working hard for others' sakes.

00:14:57.480 --> 00:15:00.608
You're always holding something
back for some reason.

00:15:00.774 --> 00:15:03.611
You never show interest in doing
things for your own enjoyment.

00:15:03.777 --> 00:15:05.779
Even your desire to keep the school open...

00:15:05.946 --> 00:15:07.907
is due to your sense of responsibility
as our student council president!

00:15:08.073 --> 00:15:12.077
Don't you think that's why the director
won't respond to your requests?

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:18.834
So, tell me. What do you really want to do?

00:15:19.543 --> 00:15:21.629
Let's give it another go!

00:15:21.795 --> 00:15:23.714
One, two, three, four...

00:15:23.881 --> 00:15:25.799
Five, six, seven, eight!

00:15:25.966 --> 00:15:27.885
One, two, three, four...

00:15:28.052 --> 00:15:29.803
Five, six, seven, eight!

00:15:29.970 --> 00:15:32.223
One, two, three, four...

00:15:34.683 --> 00:15:36.227
What are you...?

00:15:36.393 --> 00:15:39.146
I have no choice but to do
something about this!

00:15:40.856 --> 00:15:45.694
How I wish all my problems could be
solved by doing only the things I want!

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:54.745
I know I'm an awkward mess, but still...

00:15:56.288 --> 00:15:58.499
Do you really expect me
to be able to tell them,

00:15:58.499 --> 00:16:01.043
after all I've done, that I want
to become an idol, too?

00:16:29.655 --> 00:16:32.199
What I want to do...

00:16:33.284 --> 00:16:34.368
That's...

00:16:51.802 --> 00:16:52.886
You all...?

00:16:53.304 --> 00:16:54.638
Student Council President.

00:16:54.805 --> 00:16:56.640
No, Eli-senpai.

00:16:56.807 --> 00:16:57.975
We have a request.

00:16:58.517 --> 00:16:59.685
More coaching?

00:16:59.852 --> 00:17:02.354
Just do the same things
I showed you yester—

00:17:02.354 --> 00:17:05.232
Eli-senpai, please join J's.

00:17:05.232 --> 00:17:06.025
Huh?

00:17:06.191 --> 00:17:08.694
We'd love it if you'd sing with p's...

00:17:08.861 --> 00:17:10.404
as a fellow school idol!

00:17:11.488 --> 00:17:12.740
Is this a joke?

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:15.701
There's absolutely no way I'd do that.

00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:18.579
Nozomi-senpai told us everything.

00:17:19.121 --> 00:17:21.749
If there's something you
want to do, just say so.

00:17:21.915 --> 00:17:24.376
You're one to talk, Nico-senpai.

00:17:24.376 --> 00:17:27.254
Hold on. I never said I wanted to do anything!

00:17:27.796 --> 00:17:30.966
Besides, my becoming a school
idol would seem strange now.

00:17:31.342 --> 00:17:32.551
Why not give it a try?

00:17:33.761 --> 00:17:36.055
Needing a reason is so unnecessary.

00:17:36.221 --> 00:17:37.890
Do it 'cuz you want to.

00:17:39.224 --> 00:17:43.520
Isn't that how everyone starts to walk the
path of doing the things they truly want?

00:18:09.505 --> 00:18:10.881
Eli-san...

00:18:10.881 --> 00:18:12.591
That makes eight!

00:18:12.758 --> 00:18:13.509
No.

00:18:14.385 --> 00:18:16.845
Nine, if you include me.

00:18:16.845 --> 00:18:18.972
What? Nozomi-senpai, you too?

00:18:19.139 --> 00:18:21.058
The cards have spoken.

00:18:21.225 --> 00:18:25.396
They said that the door to the future would
open once nine girls gather together.

00:18:26.063 --> 00:18:27.481
It's why I offered that name.

00:18:27.648 --> 00:18:30.651
M's, which represents the
nine goddesses of music.

00:18:30.818 --> 00:18:31.735
What!?

00:18:31.902 --> 00:18:33.278
S-So, you mean...

00:18:33.445 --> 00:18:37.241
Nozomi-senpai, you're the one who
wrote that name suggestion!?

00:18:39.910 --> 00:18:41.120
Nozomi...

00:18:42.204 --> 00:18:44.665
As unbelievable as ever.

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:47.584
Where are you...?

00:18:48.669 --> 00:18:49.628
That should be obvious.

00:18:51.046 --> 00:18:52.131
We must practice!

00:18:55.092 --> 00:18:57.136
All right!

00:18:58.762 --> 00:19:00.639
Hello, everyone.

00:19:01.181 --> 00:19:05.686
We're Otonokizaka High's
school idol group, u's.

00:19:05.853 --> 00:19:09.481
We love Otonokizaka High.

00:19:10.190 --> 00:19:12.860
The nine of us could meet
and form this group

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:15.362
only because we all go to Otonokizaka High.

00:19:15.738 --> 00:19:20.868
This song is the first one we've composed
since becoming a nine-member group.

00:19:22.536 --> 00:19:25.122
It signals the beginning of our future together.

00:19:26.165 --> 00:19:27.833
Listen to our newest song—

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:31.003
"Our Concert—Life With You"!

00:19:56.945 --> 00:20:05.245
Rather than hold onto the concrete present,
we want to reach for a new, abstract dream.

00:20:05.412 --> 00:20:12.669
If we boldly take the plunge,
our lives will be okay.

00:20:14.797 --> 00:20:17.883
If you're gonna dream, dream big!

00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:23.639
We will outstretch our arms and
reach up—high and far.

00:20:23.806 --> 00:20:28.310
Let's rush to embrace a
blinding, bright tomorrow!

00:20:28.477 --> 00:20:32.773
Let's make everything come true.

00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:37.027
Yes, that's right—you have to believe it...

00:20:37.194 --> 00:20:44.284
You can take charge and move
forward quickly, so let's go!

00:20:44.451 --> 00:20:48.789
Even if you say nothing,
I already know the truth.

00:20:48.956 --> 00:20:53.085
Because the place we envision
in our hearts is the same.

00:20:53.252 --> 00:21:03.053
Searching for that special place, without ever
giving up, is the challenge that we all share.

00:21:03.220 --> 00:21:07.099
Our energy will never stop boiling over!

00:21:07.266 --> 00:21:11.520
So we flutter our wings
and fly, still piping hot!

00:21:11.687 --> 00:21:16.275
That look in your eyes as you
describe your dreams...

00:21:16.441 --> 00:21:22.030
Whenever I see that resolute gaze, I like it.

00:21:25.033 --> 00:21:26.368
I love it!

00:22:01.945 --> 00:22:02.905
We did it!

00:22:03.071 --> 00:22:03.739
Yes.

00:22:15.083 --> 00:22:20.714
Sunao ni oikakete yuukide oikakete Chase after
it with honesty, chase after it with courage.

00:22:20.964 --> 00:22:26.261
Chiisana negai ga ashita wo tsukuru That one
small wish is what will help to create tomorrow.

00:22:26.595 --> 00:22:32.684
Dekirukamo minna ga nozomunara It might
be possible if we all want it to come true.

00:22:32.684 --> 00:22:39.650
Dare yori ganbacchae tonikaku Jjounetsu no mama ni Give it
more effort than anyone else and stay as passionate as ever.

00:22:39.650 --> 00:22:44.696
Mezasu no wa kireina kaze fuku michi Let's aim to
find our path while riding on a beautiful wind.

00:22:45.614 --> 00:22:51.161
Hane no youni ude agete Spread your
arms out wide like they're your own wings.

00:22:51.161 --> 00:22:56.416
Mabushii mirai e to tobuyo We'll use
them to take off into our bright future.

00:22:57.626 --> 00:23:03.924
Kitto seishun ga kikoeru sono shunkan ni kikoeru You can hear the
songs filled with our youth, you can hear it in this one moment.

00:23:04.299 --> 00:23:09.554
Egao nara itsu no hi mo daijoubu As long as
we see you smiling, every day is worth it!

00:23:09.554 --> 00:23:15.978
Kitto seishun ga kikoeru sono shunkan ga mitaine You can hear the
songs filled with our youth, we want to see you at that moment.

00:23:15.978 --> 00:23:21.817
Tonari ni kimi ga ite (ureshii keshiki) I want you
to be right beside me. (It's such happy scenery.)

00:23:21.817 --> 00:23:27.239
Tonari wa kimi nanda
Only when the one right there is you.

00:23:35.831 --> 00:23:39.334
Next time on Love Live!
"Wonder Zone"
